        "note": "I have revised this object date slightly, having seen a dress of a similar style (albeit from the Gaza, rather than Bethlehem area), that dates to before 1887. It is exceedingly difficult to date Palestinian dress with certainty beyond stylistic markers, but it's rarer to see dresses of this kind with minimal embroidery on the chest panel after 1920. "
